macubuntu (0.6.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Deepen macOS-style title bars with explicit MacTahoe traffic-light controls.
  * Apply the configured title-bar font instead of GNOME's system-font default.
  * Add a non-destructive, receipt-owned GTK4/libadwaita MacTahoe CSS bridge.
  * Preserve pre-existing user GTK4 CSS instead of overwriting it.

